  message: "FYI from WI-majov (2026-10-01), no action requested on this row: a separate js_module.py defect was filed as WI-babuk-nufoh-rolig-sabus-gobuk-zituh-sofup-holid. The import-target file id takes the importer's language (~805), so a .ts -> .js import emits module_exports from a phantom typescript:<x>.js file node. It is a different site from this row's export-status filter, but the same file; worth knowing if your fixtures mix .ts and .js."  # df15
